        "@id": "prototype:8c6aa65c-745f-473a-a5b0-9e00cfea4f04",
        "rdfs:label": "Jimmy McGill",
        "rdfs:comment": "James Morgan \"Jimmy\" McGill, better known by his alias Saul Goodman, is a fictional character created by Vince Gilligan and Peter Gould and portrayed by Bob Odenkirk in the television franchise Breaking Bad. He appears as a major character in Breaking Bad (2009–2013) and as the titular protagonist of its spin-off Better Call Saul (2015–2022).",
